      "correction": "Replace absolute InternalGap by OrderedInternalGap. The old statements were false for interlacing diagonal-block spectra; an explicit three-dimensional quarter-turn counterexample is recorded in dev/tan-two-theta-ordered-gap-correction-2026-07-20.md.",
