    {
      "correction": "Replace the ill-typed InternalGap body by the source-complete interval/exterior residual signature. The residual separation is between M and the unwanted spectrum of A on U orthogonal; ordered and general separated-spectrum variants are supplied alongside it. See dev/sin-two-theta-residual-gap-correction-2026-07-20.md.",
