        "spectralSubspace_path_continuous",
        "sinTwoTheta_acute_of_small_perturbation"
      ],
      "path": "DavisKahan/Experimental/FiniteDimensional/Generalized.lean"
    },
    {
      "correction": "Replace the false real pi-over-three full-displacement UI-norm endpoint by the field-generic unrestricted source-restricted displacement theorem. Multiplicity-space mixing gives counterexamples to the historical full-displacement claim.",
